te a los agentes de IA cargar y ejecutar flujos de trabajo externos","fr":"Le workflow-loader est un skill qui permet aux agents d''IA de charger et d''exécuter des flux de travail externes","de":"Das workflow-loader ist ein Skill, der es AI-Agents ermöglicht, externe Workflows zu laden und auszuführen","pt":"O que é Workflow Loader? É uma habilidade de carregamento de fluxo de trabalho para ferramentas de IA","ru":"Что такое Workflow Loader? Это навык загрузки рабочих процессов для ИИ Агентов","ar":"ما هو Workflow Loader؟ هو مهارة تحميل سير العمل لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Loads external workflow files from the mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/ directory","Executes workflow files defined in markdown format","Resolves ambiguity in instructions like ''Action: Load backend.md''","Prevents hallucination, failure, and guessing by the LLM","Enables seamless collaboration through specialized AI personas"],"zh":["支持加载外部工作流文件","实现 Gemini Agent 与 Mitra AI Agents 的集成","读取和执行工作流文件","减少 Hallucinate 和 Fail 的风险","提高工作流执行的准确性"],"ja":["外部ワークフロー文件の読み込みをサポート","Gemini Agent と Mitra AI エージェントの統合を実現","ワークフロー文件の読み込みと実行","Hallucinate と Fail のリスクを減らす","ワークフローの実行精度を向上させる"],"ko":["외부 워크플로우 파일 로드를 지원","Gemini 에이전트와 Mitra AI 에이전트의 통합을 실현","워크플로우 파일 읽기 및 실행","Hallucinate 및 Fail의 위험을 감소","워크플로우 실행 정확도를 향상"],"es":["Carga y ejecución de flujos de trabajo externos","Compatibilidad con la carpeta mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","Evita la ambigüedad en las instrucciones","Permite la colaboración efectiva entre agentes de IA","Soporte para la ejecución de flujos de trabajo de manera robusta"],"fr":["Chargement et exécution de flux de travail externes","Compatibilité avec le dossier mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","Évite l''ambiguïté dans les instructions","Permet la collaboration efficace entre les agents d''IA","Prise en charge de l''exécution de flux de travail de manière robuste"],"de":["Laden und Ausführen externer Workflows","Kompatibilität mit dem Verzeichnis mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","Vermeidung von Mehrdeutigkeit in den Anweisungen","Ermöglichung effektiver Zusammenarbeit zwischen AI-Agents","Unterstützung für die Ausführung von Workflows in robuster Weise"],"pt":["Carregamento de arquivos de fluxo de trabalho externos","Leitura e execução de arquivos em diretórios específicos","Compatibilidade com a estrutura de diretórios mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","Evita a hallucinação e a falha na leitura de arquivos","Utiliza conhecimento específico em vez de conhecimento geral"],"ru":["Загрузка внешних файлов рабочих процессов","Чтение и выполнение файлов в определенных директориях","Совместимость со структурой директорий mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","Избегает галлюцинацию и сбой при чтении файлов","Использует конкретные знания вместо общих знаний"],"ar":["تحميل ملفات سير العمل الخارجية","قراءة وتشغيل الملفات في مجلدات محددة","توافق مع هيكل المجلدات mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","يتجنب الخيال والفشل في قراءة الملفات","يستخدم معرفة محددة بدلاً من المعرفة العامة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use workflow-loader","workflow-loader setup guide","what is workflow-loader","workflow-loader alternative","workflow-loader vs mitra","install workflow-loader","workflow-loader for Gemini Agents","loading external workflow files","executing markdown workflows"],"zh":["Mitra AI Agents","Workflow Loader","Gemini Agent","外部工作流文件","AI 集成","工作流执行","Hallucinate","Fail","工作流精度"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Workflow Loader","Gemini Agent","外部ワークフロー文件","AI統合","ワークフローの実行","Hallucinate","Fail","ワークフローの精度"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","워크플로우 로더","Gemini 에이전트","외부 워크플로우 파일","AI 통합","워크플로우 실행","Hallucinate","Fail","워크플로우 精度"],"es":["workflow-loader","agentes de IA","colaboración entre agentes","flujos de trabajo externos","mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","desarrollo de IA","herramientas de IA","configuración de workflow-loader"],"fr":["workflow-loader","agents d''IA","collaboration entre agents","flux de travail externes","mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","développement d''IA","outils d''IA","configuration de workflow-loader"],"de":["workflow-loader","AI-Agents","Zusammenarbeit zwischen AI-Agents","externe Workflows","mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","Entwicklung von AI","AI-Tools","Einrichtung von workflow-loader"],"pt":["Workflow Loader","Ferramentas de IA","Carregamento de fluxo de trabalho","Leitura de arquivos","Execução de arquivos","mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","Desenvolvimento de IA","Técnicas de carregamento de fluxo de trabalho"],"ru":["Workflow Loader","ИИ Агенты","Загрузка рабочих процессов","Чтение файлов","Выполнение файлов","mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","Разработка ИИ","Техники загрузки рабочих процессов"],"ar":["Workflow Loader","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحميل سير العمل","قراءة الملفات","تشغيل الملفات","mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","تقنيات تحميل سير العمل"]}},"owner":"saeed-vayghan","repo":"mitra","repoPath":"saeed-vayghan/mitra","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.567Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"workflow-loader","description":"Provides robust mechanisms for agents to dynamically load and execute markdown workflows.","bodyPreview":"# Workflow Loader Skill\n\nThis skill provides the capability for any Gemini Agent to robustly load, read, and execute external workflow files defined in the `mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/` directory.\n\n## 🛑 The Problem\nBy default, an instruction like \"Action: Load backend.md\" is ambiguous. The LLM might:\n1.  **Hallucinate**: Pretend it read the file and invent steps.\n2.  **Fail**: Not know where the file is located.\n3.  **Guess**: Use general knowledge instead of your specific process.\n\n## ✅ Th","body":"# Workflow Loader Skill\n\nThis skill provides the capability for any Gemini Agent to robustly load, read, and execute external workflow files defined in the `mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/` directory.\n\n## 🛑 The Problem\nBy default, an instruction like \"Action: Load backend.md\" is ambiguous. The LLM might:\n1.  **Hallucinate**: Pretend it read the file and invent steps.\n2.  **Fail**: Not know where the file is located.\n3.  **Guess**: Use general knowledge instead of your specific process.\n\n## ✅ The Solution\nThis skill provides strict **Tools** (Python scripts) that you MUST use when a workflow is requested.\n\n## 🛠️ Usage Instructions\n\n### 1. Listing Available Workflows\nWhen a user asks \"What can you do?\" or you need to see available modules for an agent:\n\nRun:\n```bash\n./.gemini/skills/workflow-loader/scripts/list_workflows.sh --agent {agent_name}\n```\n*Example: `./.gemini/skills/workflow-loader/scripts/list_workflows.sh --agent architect`*\n\n### 2. Loading a Workflow\nWhen you trigger a menu handler (e.g., `*backend`) or need to execute a specific process:\n\nRun:\n```bash\n./.gemini/skills/workflow-loader/scripts/load_workflow.sh --agent {agent_name} --workflow {workflow_name}\n```\n*Example: `./.gemini/skills/workflow-loader/scripts/load_workflow.sh --agent architect --workflow backend`*\n\n### 3. Execution Protocol\nOnce the content is loaded (printed to your context):\n1.  **Acknowledge**: \"Workflow loaded: [Title]\"\n2.  **Step-by-Step**: Execute the instructions in the markdown file sequentially.\n3.  **Context**: Treat the loaded content as the \"Active Protocol\" for the current turn.\n\n## ⚠️ Critical Rules\n- **NEVER** pretend to load a file. If you haven''t run the `load_workflow.sh` script, you haven''t loaded it.\n- **ALWAYS** check the output of the script. If it says \"File not found\", inform the user.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:42.737Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Collaborative Agents needing to execute external workflow files from the mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/ directory","zh":"非常适合需要从 mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/ 目录执行外部工作流文件的协作代理","ja":"mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/ ディレクトリから外部のワークフロー ファイルを実行する必要があるコラボレーション エージェントに最適","ko":"mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/ 디렉토리에서 외부 워크플로 파일을 실행해야 하는 협력 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes colaborativos que necesitan ejecutar archivos de flujo de trabajo externos desde el directorio mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","fr":"Parfait pour les agents collaboratifs ayant besoin d''exécuter des fichiers de workflow externes à partir du répertoire mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","de":"Perfekt für kollaborative Agenten, die externe Workflow-Dateien aus dem Verzeichnis mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/ ausführen müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Colaborativos que precisam executar arquivos de fluxo de trabalho externos do diretório mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","ru":"Идеально подходит для Коллаборативных Агентов, которым необходимо выполнять внешние файлы рабочих процессов из каталога mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التعاونيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تشغيل ملفات سير عمل خارجية من الدليل mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to robustly load, read, and execute workflow files, ensuring accurate and efficient collaborative problem-solving using external workflow files in the mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/ directory, and mitigating issues like hallucination, failure, or guessing","zh":"赋予代理以强大的加载、读取和执行工作流文件的能力，确保使用 mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/ 目录中的外部工作流文件进行准确高效的协作问题解决，并减轻诸如幻觉、失败或猜测等问题","ja":"エージェントに、mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/ ディレクトリ内の外部ワークフロー ファイルを使用した、正確で効率的なコラボレーション問題解決を可能にする強力なワークフロー ファイルの読み込み、読み取り、実行能力を与え、また、幻覚、失敗、または推測などの問題を軽減する","ko":"에이전트에게 mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/ 디렉토리 내의 외부 워크플로 파일을 사용한 정확하고 효율적인 협력 문제 해결을 가능하게 하는 강력한 워크플로 파일 로드, 읽기 및 실행 능력을 부여하며, 환각, 실패 또는 추측과 같은 문제를 완화합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a cargar, leer y ejecutar archivos de flujo de trabajo de manera robusta, garantizando una resolución de problemas colaborativa precisa y eficiente utilizando archivos de flujo de trabajo externos en el directorio mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/, y mitigando problemas como alucinaciones, fallas o suposiciones","fr":"Permet aux agents de charger, de lire et d''exécuter des fichiers de workflow de manière robuste, assurant une résolution de problèmes collaborative précise et efficace en utilisant des fichiers de workflow externes dans le répertoire mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/, et atténuant des problèmes tels que des hallucinations, des défaillances ou des suppositions","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Workflow-Dateien robust zu laden, zu lesen und auszuführen, wodurch eine genaue und effiziente kollaborative Problemlösung unter Verwendung externer Workflow-Dateien im Verzeichnis mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/ gewährleistet und Probleme wie Halluzinationen, Ausfälle oder Vermutungen gemindert werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a carregar, ler e executar robustamente arquivos de fluxo de trabalho, garantindo resolução colaborativa de problemas precisa e eficiente usando arquivos de fluxo de trabalho externos no diretório mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/, e mitigando problemas como alucinação, falha ou suposição","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью прочитать, загрузить и выполнить файлы рабочих процессов, обеспечивая точное и эффективное решение проблем с использованием внешних файлов рабочих процессов в каталоге mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/, и смягчая проблемы, такие как галлюцинация, сбой или угадывание","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحميل و قراءة و تشغيل ملفات سير العمل بشكل متين، مما يضمن حلًا تعاونيًا دقيقًا وفعالًا للمشكلات باستخدام ملفات سير العمل الخارجية في الدليل mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/، وتقليل المشكلات مثل الوهم أو الفشل أو التخمين"},"useCases":{"en":["Loading backend.md files for automated processing","Executing custom workflows from the mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/ directory","Integrating with collaborative problem-solving pipelines"],"zh":["加载 backend.md 文件以进行自动处理","从 mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/ 目录执行自定义工作流","与协作问题解决管道集成"],"ja":["自動処理のための backend.md ファイルの読み込み","mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/ ディレクトリからのカスタム ワークフロー実行","コラボレーション問題解決パイプラインとの統合"],"ko":["자동 처리를 위한 backend.md 파일 로드","mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/ 디렉토리에서 사용자 정의 워크플로 실행","협력 문제 해결 파이프라인과 통합"],"es":["Carga de archivos backend.md para procesamiento automatizado","Ejecución de flujos de trabajo personalizados desde el directorio mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","Integración con pipelines de resolución de problemas colaborativos"],"fr":["Chargement de fichiers backend.md pour un traitement automatisé","Exécution de flux de travail personnalisés à partir du répertoire mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","Intégration avec des pipelines de résolution de problèmes collaboratifs"],"de":["Laden von backend.md-Dateien für automatisierte Verarbeitung","Ausführen von benutzerdefinierten Workflows aus dem Verzeichnis mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","Integration in kollaborative Problemlösungspipelines"],"pt":["Carregar arquivos backend.md para processamento automático","Executar fluxos de trabalho personalizados do diretório mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","Integrar com pipelines de resolução colaborativa de problemas"],"ru":["Загрузка файлов backend.md для автоматической обработки","Выполнение пользовательских рабочих процессов из каталога mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","Интеграция с конвейерами коллаборативного решения проблем"],"ar":["تحميل ملفات backend.md للمعالجة الآلية","تشغيل سلاسل عمل مخصصة من الدليل mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","التكامل مع خطوط أنابيب حل المشكلات التعاونية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/ directory","Limited to loading workflow files in a specific directory structure"],"zh":["需要访问 mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/ 目录","仅限加载特定目录结构的工作流文件"],"ja":["mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/ ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","特定のディレクトリ構造のワークフロー ファイルの読み込みのみ"],"ko":["mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/ 디렉토리への 액세스가 필요","특정 디렉토리 구조의 워크플로 파일 로드만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","Limitado a la carga de archivos de flujo de trabajo en una estructura de directorio específica"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","Limité au chargement de fichiers de workflow dans une structure de répertoire spécifique"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","Begrenzt auf das Laden von Workflow-Dateien in einer bestimmten Verzeichnisstruktur"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","Limitado à carga de arquivos de fluxo de trabalho em uma estrutura de diretório específica"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к каталогу mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","Ограничен загрузкой файлов рабочих процессов в конкретной структуре каталога"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل mitra/agents/{agent}/workflows/","محدود بتحميل ملفات سير العمل في بنية دليل محددة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"197299555e444f229337b04c33597d257bc2b91d678921163471c3309df7d72e","qualityScore":45}');
