INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('agentydragon/ducktape/reverse_engineer', 'reverse_engineer', 'agentydragon', 'ducktape', 'community', 'reverse_engineer agentydragon ducktape community The reverse_engineer skill provides a comprehensive guide for reverse engineering binaries, allowing developers to choose techniques based on their needs, such as full reconstruction or function analysis. 逆向工程工具提供了二进制重构、函数分析、协议文档和版本比较的综合解决方案 リバースエンジニアリングツールは、バイナリ再構築、関数分析、プロトコル文書化、バージョン比較のための包括的なソリューションを提供します 역공학 툴킷은 바이너리 재구성, 함수 분석, 프로토콜 문서화, 버전 비교를 위한 종합적인 솔루션을 제공합니다 El kit de herramientas de reverse_engineer ofrece una guía completa para la ingeniería inversa de binaries, con técnicas de reconstrucción y análisis de funciones Le kit de reverse_engineer propose un guide complet pour l''ingénierie inverse de binaries, avec des techniques de reconstruction et d''analyse de fonctions Das Reverse Engineering Toolkit bietet eine umfassende Anleitung für die Reverse Engineering von Binaries, mit Techniken wie Rekonstruktion und Funktionsanalyse O Reverse Engineer é uma ferramenta de engenharia reversa que permite reconstruir códigos-fonte, analisar funções e documentar protocolos Инструмент обратного инжиниринга - это инструмент инжиниринга, который позволяет восстанавливать исходный код, анализировать функции и документировать протоколы العكس هندسة هي أداة هندسة معكوسة تسمح بإعادة بناء الشفرة المصدر، وتحليل الوظائف، وتوثيق البروتوكولات how to use reverse_engineer reverse engineering toolkit binary reconstruction techniques function analysis tools protocol documentation guide reverse_engineer alternative reverse_engineer install reverse_engineer setup guide binary analysis with reverse_engineer 逆向工程 二进制重构 函数分析 协议文档 版本比较 AI工具 软件开发 逆向工程工具 Full reconstruction of binaries into complete, compilable source code Function analysis for understanding specific parts of the binary Protocol documentation for generating API specs and wire formats Version comparison for identifying changes between releases Deepening existing reverse engineering efforts to fill gaps in partial reconstructions reverse_engineer is a toolkit for reverse engineering binaries, enabling developers to reconstruct source code, analyze functions, and document protocols.');
