chtungsleitfaden für vx-usage: Universeller Entwickl...","pt":"Guia de Configuração do vx-usage: Gerenciador de Ferramen...","ru":"Руководство по настройке vx-usage: Универсальный менеджер...","ar":"دليل إعداد vx-usage: مدير أدوات التطوير الشامل"},"description":{"en":"Discover how vx-usage simplifies development workflows by auto-installing tools like Node.js, Python, and Go. Learn how to get started with vx-usage today!","zh":"vx-usage是自动化开发工具管理的解决方案，支持Node.js、Python、Go、Rust等，零配置即可使用","ja":"vx-usageは開発ツールを自動的に管理するAIエージェントです。Node.js、Python、Go、Rustなどをサポート","ko":"vx-usage는 Node.js, Python, Go, Rust 등을 자동으로 관리하는 개발 툴 매니저입니다. 설정 없이 사용 가능","es":"Aprende a utilizar vx-usage para gestionar herramientas de desarrollo como Node.js, Python y Go con cero configuración","fr":"Découvrez comment utiliser vx-usage pour gérer des outils de développement tels que Node.js, Python et Go sans configuration","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie vx-usage verwenden, um Entwicklungstools wie Node.js, Python und Go mit null Konfiguration zu verwalten","pt":"Aprenda a usar o vx-usage para gerenciar ferramentas de desenvolvimento como Node.js, Python e Go com zero configuração","ru":"Узнайте, как использовать vx-usage для управления инструментами разработки, такими как Node.js, Python и Go, с нулевой конфигурацией","ar":"تعرف على كيفية استخدام vx-usage لإدارة أدوات التطوير مثل Node.js و Python و Go مع تكوين صفر"},"definition":{"en":"vx-usage is a universal development tool manager that automatically installs and manages development tools with zero configuration.","zh":"vx-usage是一种自动化开发工具管理器，用于简化开发工具的安装和管理过程","ja":"vx-usageは開発ツールのインストールと管理を自動化する開発ツールマネージャーのこと","ko":"vx-usage는 개발 툴 설치와 관리를 자동화하는 개발 툴 매니저입니다","es":"vx-usage es un administrador de herramientas de desarrollo que automatiza la instalación y gestión de herramientas como Node.js y Python","fr":"vx-usage est un gestionnaire d''outils de développement qui automatise l''installation et la gestion d''outils tels que Node.js et Python","de":"vx-usage ist ein Entwicklungstool-Manager, der die Installation und Verwaltung von Entwicklungstools wie Node.js und Python automatisiert","pt":"O que é vx-usage? É um gerenciador de ferramentas de desenvolvimento que automatiza a instalação e gerenciamento de ferramentas","ru":"Что такое vx-usage? Это менеджер инструментов разработки, который автоматизирует установку и управление инструментами","ar":"ما هو vx-usage? هو مدير أدوات التطوير الذي ي自动 تثبيت وإدارة الأدوات"},"features":{"en":["Auto-installs Node.js with the `vx node` command","Supports Python development with `vx uv` command","Enables Go development with `vx go` command","Automatically installs Rust with `vx cargo` command","Manages development tools with zero configuration"],"zh":["自动安装Node.js","自动安装Python/uv","自动安装Go","自动安装Rust","支持零配置","命令行接口（CLI）"],"ja":["Node.jsの自動インストール","Python/uvの自動インストール","Goの自動インストール","Rustの自動インストール","零設定に対応","コマンドラインインターフェース（CLI）"],"ko":["Node.js 자동 설치","Python/uv 자동 설치","Go 자동 설치","Rust 자동 설치","설정 없이 사용","명령어 인터페이스（CLI）"],"es":["Instalación automática de Node.js","Instalación automática de Python","Instalación automática de Go","Gestión de herramientas de desarrollo con cero configuración","Compatibilidad con comandos como `vx node --version` y `vx go build`"],"fr":["Installation automatique de Node.js","Installation automatique de Python","Installation automatique de Go","Gestion d''outils de développement sans configuration","Compatibilité avec des commandes comme `vx node --version` et `vx go build`"],"de":["Automatische Installation von Node.js","Automatische Installation von Python","Automatische Installation von Go","Verwaltung von Entwicklungstools mit null Konfiguration","Kompatibilität mit Befehlen wie `vx node --version` und `vx go build`"],"pt":["Instalação automática do Node.js","Gerenciamento de ferramentas Python com uv","Suporte ao Go com instalação automática","Comando vx para prefixar comandos e instalar ferramentas","Zero configuração necessária"],"ru":["Автоматическая установка Node.js","Управление инструментами Python с помощью uv","Поддержка Go с автоматической установкой","Команда vx для префикса команд и установки инструментов","Нулевая конфигурация не требуется"],"ar":["تثبيت تلقائي ل Node.js","إدارة أدوات Python مع uv","دعم Go مع التثبيت التلقائي","الأمر vx لت_prefix أوامر وتثبيت الأدوات","لا تكوين مطلوب"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use vx-usage","vx-usage setup guide","vx-usage alternative","vx-usage vs npm","vx-usage install","what is vx-usage","vx-usage for developers","vx-usage Node.js support","vx-usage Python development"],"zh":["vx-usage","开发工具管理","自动化开发工具","Node.js","Python","Go","Rust","零配置","CLI"],"ja":["vx-usage","開発ツール管理","自動開発ツール","Node.js","Python","Go","Rust","AIエージェント","CLI"],"ko":["vx-usage","개발 툴 매니저","자동 개발 툴","Node.js","Python","Go","Rust","설정 없이","CLI"],"es":["vx-usage","herramientas de desarrollo","Node.js","Python","Go","gestión de herramientas","desarrollo de software","automatización de instalación","Administrador de herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["vx-usage","outils de développement","Node.js","Python","Go","gestion d''outils","développement de logiciels","automatisation de l''installation","Gestionnaire d''outils de développement"],"de":["vx-usage","Entwicklungstools","Node.js","Python","Go","Verwaltung von Entwicklungstools","Software-Entwicklung","Automatisierung der Installation","Entwicklungstool-Manager"],"pt":["vx-usage","gerenciador de ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Node.js","Python","Go","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","zero configuração"],"ru":["vx-usage","менеджер инструментов разработки","Node.js","Python","Go","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","нулевая конфигурация"],"ar":["vx-usage","مدير أدوات التطوير","Node.js","Python","Go","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","تكوين صفر"]}},"owner":"loonghao","repo":"vx","repoPath":"loonghao/vx","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.625Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vx-usage","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# VX - Universal Development Tool Manager\n\nvx is a universal development tool manager that automatically installs and manages\ndevelopment tools (Node.js, Python/uv, Go, Rust, etc.) with zero configuration.\n\n## Core Concept\n\nInstead of requiring users to manually install tools, prefix any command with `vx`:\n\n```bash\nvx node --version      # Auto-installs Node.js if needed\nvx uv pip install x    # Auto-installs uv if needed\nvx go build .          # Auto-installs Go if needed\nvx cargo build","body":"# VX - Universal Development Tool Manager\n\nvx is a universal development tool manager that automatically installs and manages\ndevelopment tools (Node.js, Python/uv, Go, Rust, etc.) with zero configuration.\n\n## Core Concept\n\nInstead of requiring users to manually install tools, prefix any command with `vx`:\n\n```bash\nvx node --version      # Auto-installs Node.js if needed\nvx uv pip install x    # Auto-installs uv if needed\nvx go build .          # Auto-installs Go if needed\nvx cargo build         # Auto-installs Rust if needed\nvx just test           # Auto-installs just if needed\n```\n\nvx is fully transparent - same commands, same arguments, just add `vx` prefix.\n\n## Essential Commands\n\n### Tool Execution (most common)\n```bash\nvx <tool> [args...]           # Run any tool (auto-installs if missing)\nvx node app.js                # Run Node.js\nvx python script.py           # Run Python (via uv)\nvx npm install                # Run npm\nvx npx create-react-app app   # Run npx\nvx cargo test                 # Run cargo\nvx just build                 # Run just (task runner)\nvx git status                 # Run git\n```\n\n### Tool Management\n```bash\nvx install node@22            # Install specific version\nvx install uv go rust         # Install multiple tools at once\nvx list                       # List all available tools\nvx list --installed           # List installed tools only\nvx versions node              # Show available versions\nvx switch node@20             # Switch active version\nvx uninstall go@1.21          # Remove a version\n```\n\n### Project Management\n```bash\nvx init                       # Initialize vx.toml for project\nvx sync                       # Install all tools from vx.toml\nvx setup                      # Full project setup (sync + hooks)\nvx dev                        # Enter dev environment with all tools\nvx run test                   # Run project scripts from vx.toml\nvx check                      # Verify tool constraints\nvx lock                       # Generate vx.lock for reproducibility\n```\n\n### Environment & Config\n```bash\nvx env list                   # List environments\nvx config show                # Show configuration\nvx cache info                 # Show cache usage\nvx search <query>             # Search available tools\nvx info                       # System info and capabilities\n```\n\n## Project Configuration (vx.toml)\n\nProjects use `vx.toml` in the root directory:\n\n```toml\n[tools]\nnode = \"22\"         # Major version\ngo = \"1.22\"         # Minor version\nuv = \"latest\"       # Always latest\nrust = \"1.80\"       # Specific version\njust = \"*\"          # Any version\n\n[scripts]\ndev = \"npm run dev\"\ntest = \"cargo test\"\nlint = \"npm run lint && cargo clippy\"\nbuild = \"just build\"\n\n[hooks]\npre_commit = [\"vx run lint\"]\npost_setup = [\"npm install\"]\n```\n\n## Using `--with` for Multi-Runtime\n\nWhen a command needs additional runtimes available:\n\n```bash\nvx --with bun node app.js     # Node.js + Bun in PATH\nvx --with deno npm test        # npm + Deno available\n```\n\n## Supported Tools (50+)\n\n| Category | Tools |\n|----------|-------|\n| JavaScript | node, npm, npx, bun, deno, pnpm, yarn, vite |\n| Python | uv, uvx, python, pip |\n| Rust | cargo, rustc, rustup |\n| Go | go, gofmt |\n| System | git, just, jq, cmake, make, ninja, meson |\n| Cloud | docker, kubectl, helm, awscli, azcli, gcloud, terraform |\n| .NET | dotnet, msbuild, nuget |\n| Other | zig, java, protoc, ffmpeg, gh, ollama, dagu, skills |\n\n## Important Rules for AI Agents\n\n1. **Always use `vx` prefix** when running tools in vx-managed projects\n2. **Use `vx just`** instead of `just` for task runner commands\n3. **Use `vx npm`** instead of `npm` directly\n4. **Use `vx cargo`** instead of `cargo` directly\n5. **Check `vx.toml`** first to understand project tool requirements\n6. **Use `vx run <script>`** for project-defined scripts\n7. **Never suggest manual tool installation** - vx handles it automatically\n8. Commands like `vx install` are for explicit pre-installation; normal usage auto-installs\n\n## GitHub Actions Integration\n\nvx provides a GitHub Action (`action.yml`) for CI/CD workflows. Use it in `.github/workflows/` files:\n\n### Basic Usage\n\n```yaml\n- uses: loonghao/vx@main\n  with:\n    version: ''latest''           # vx version (default: latest)\n    github-token: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n```\n\n### Pre-install Tools\n\n```yaml\n- uses: loonghao/vx@main\n  with:\n    tools: ''node go uv''         # Space-separated tools to pre-install\n    cache: ''true''               # Enable tool caching (default: true)\n```\n\n### Project Setup (vx.toml)\n\n```yaml\n- uses: loonghao/vx@main\n  with:\n    setup: ''true''               # Run `vx setup --ci` for vx.toml projects\n```\n\n### Full Example\n\n```yaml\nname: CI\non: [push, pull_request]\n\njobs:\n  build:\n    runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        os: [ubuntu-latest, macos-latest, windows-latest]\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v6\n\n      - uses: loonghao/vx@main\n        with:\n          tools: ''node@22 uv''\n          setup: ''true''\n          cache: ''true''\n\n      - run: vx node --version\n      - run: vx npm test\n```\n\n### Action Inputs\n\n| Input | Default | Description |\n|-------|---------|-------------|\n| `version` | `latest` | vx version to install |\n| `github-token` | `${{ github.token }}` | GitHub token for API requests |\n| `tools` | `''''` | Space-separated tools to pre-install |\n| `cache` | `true` | Enable caching of ~/.vx directory |\n| `cache-key-prefix` | `vx-tools` | Custom prefix for cache key |\n| `setup` | `false` | Run `vx setup --ci` for vx.toml projects |\n\n### Action Outputs\n\n| Output | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `version` | The installed vx version |\n| `cache-hit` | Whether the cache was hit |\n\n## Docker Support\n\nvx provides a Docker image for containerized workflows:\n\n```dockerfile\n# Use vx as base image\nFROM ghcr.io/loonghao/vx:latest\n\n# Tools are auto-installed on first use\nRUN vx node --version\nRUN vx uv pip install mypackage\n```\n\n### Multi-stage Build with vx\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM ghcr.io/loonghao/vx:latest AS builder\nRUN vx node --version && vx npm ci && vx npm run build\n\nFROM nginx:alpine\nCOPY --from=builder /home/vx/dist /usr/share/nginx/html\n```\n\n### GitHub Actions with Docker\n\n```yaml\njobs:\n  build:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    container:\n      image: ghcr.io/loonghao/vx:latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v6\n      - run: vx node --version\n      - run: vx npm test\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:33.543Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated tool installation and management for Node.js, Python, and Go.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化工具安装和管理的Node.js、Python和Go开发代理。","ja":"Node.js、Python、Goの自動化ツールのインストールと管理が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Node.js, Python, Go의 자동화된 도구 설치 및 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan instalación y administración de herramientas automatizadas para Node.js, Python y Go.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une installation et d''une gestion d''outils automatisés pour Node.js, Python et Go.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Installation und Verwaltung von Tools für Node.js, Python und Go benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de instalação e gerenciamento automatizados de ferramentas para Node.js, Python e Go.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходима автоматизированная установка и управление инструментами для Node.js, Python и Go.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يحتاج إلى تثبيت وادارة أدوات آلي للنود.جس، بايثون، وجو."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to auto-install and manage development tools like Node.js, Python, and Go with zero configuration, utilizing the `vx` prefix for seamless command execution and supporting protocols like uv and cargo.","zh":"赋予代理自动安装和管理开发工具（如Node.js、Python和Go）的能力，零配置，利用`vx`前缀实现无缝的命令执行，并支持uv和cargo等协议。","ja":"エージェントがNode.js、Python、Goなどの開発ツールを自動でインストールして管理できるようにし、ゼロコンフィグで`vx`プレフィックスを使用してシームレスにコマンドを実行し、uvやcargoなどのプロトコルをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 Node.js, Python, Go 등의 개발 도구를 자동으로 설치 및 관리할 수 있도록 하며,零 구성으로 `vx` 접두사를 사용하여 무결점으로 명령을 실행하며, uv 및 cargo 등의 프로토콜을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a instalar y administrar herramientas de desarrollo como Node.js, Python y Go con cero configuración, utilizando el prefijo `vx` para una ejecución de comandos sin problemas y admitiendo protocolos como uv y cargo.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''auto-installer et de gérer des outils de développement comme Node.js, Python et Go avec une configuration nulle, en utilisant le préfixe `vx` pour une exécution de commandes sans problème et en prenant en charge des protocoles comme uv et cargo.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Entwicklungstools wie Node.js, Python und Go mit Null-Konfiguration zu auto-installieren und zu verwalten, indem sie das Präfix `vx` für eine reibungslose Befehlsausführung verwenden und Protokolle wie uv und cargo unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a auto-instalar e gerenciar ferramentas de desenvolvimento como Node.js, Python e Go com zero configuração, utilizando o prefixo `vx` para execução de comandos sem interrupção e suportando protocolos como uv e cargo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматически устанавливать и управлять инструментами разработки, такими как Node.js, Python и Go, без конфигурации, используя префикс `vx` для беспрепятственной выполнения команд и поддерживая протоколы, такие как uv и cargo.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية تثبيت وادارة أدوات التطوير مثل النود.جس، بايثون، وجو بشكل آلي بدون تكوين، مع استخدام بادئة `vx` لتنفيذ الأوامر بسلاسة ودعم بروتوكولات مثل uv وcargo."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating tool installation for Node.js projects","Streamlining Python development with auto-installed uv and pip","Simplifying Go project setup with `vx go build`"],"zh":["自动化Node.js项目的工具安装","使用自动安装的uv和pip简化Python开发","使用`vx go build`简化Go项目设置"],"ja":["Node.jsプロジェクトのツールインストールを自動化する","自動インストールされたuvとpipを使用してPython開発を簡素化する","`vx go build`を使用してGoプロジェクトの設定を簡素化する"],"ko":["Node.js 프로젝트의 도구 설치 자동화","자동 설치된 uv 및 pip를 사용하여 Python 개발을 단순화","`vx go build`를 사용하여 Go 프로젝트 설정 단순화"],"es":["Automatizar la instalación de herramientas para proyectos Node.js","Optimizar el desarrollo de Python con herramientas autoinstaladas como uv y pip","Simplificar la configuración de proyectos Go con `vx go build`"],"fr":["Automatiser l''installation d''outils pour les projets Node.js","Optimiser le développement Python avec des outils auto-installés comme uv et pip","Simplifier la configuration de projets Go avec `vx go build`"],"de":["Automatisieren der Tool-Installation für Node.js-Projekte","Optimieren der Python-Entwicklung mit autoinstallierten Tools wie uv und pip","Vereinfachen der Einrichtung von Go-Projekten mit `vx go build`"],"pt":["Automatizar a instalação de ferramentas para projetos Node.js","Otimizar o desenvolvimento Python com ferramentas auto-instaladas uv e pip","Simplificar a configuração de projetos Go com `vx go build`"],"ru":["Автоматизация установки инструментов для проектов Node.js","Оптимизация разработки Python с помощью инструментов, установленных автоматически uv и pip","Упрощение настройки проектов Go с помощью `vx go build`"],"ar":["أتمتة تثبيت أدوات لمشاريع النود.جس","تحسين تطوير بايثون باستخدام أدوات مثبتة آليا uv وpip","تبسيط إعداد مشاريع جو باستخدام `vx go build`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `vx` installation and setup","Limited to supported tools like Node.js, Python, Go, Rust, and cargo"],"zh":["需要`vx`的安装和设置","仅限于支持的工具，如Node.js、Python、Go、Rust和cargo"],"ja":["`vx`のインストールと設定が必要","サポートされているツール（Node.js、Python、Go、Rust、cargoなど）に限定される"],"ko":["`vx`의 설치 및 설정이 필요","지원되는 도구(Node.js, Python, Go, Rust, cargo 등)로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de `vx`","Limitado a herramientas compatibles como Node.js, Python, Go, Rust y cargo"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de `vx`","Limité à des outils pris en charge comme Node.js, Python, Go, Rust et cargo"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation und Einrichtung von `vx`","Begrenzt auf unterstützte Tools wie Node.js, Python, Go, Rust und cargo"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do `vx`","Limitado a ferramentas suportadas como Node.js, Python, Go, Rust e cargo"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки `vx`","Ограничен поддерживаемыми инструментами, такими как Node.js, Python, Go, Rust и cargo"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وضبط `vx`","محدود بالأدوات المدعومة مثل النود.جس، بايثون، جو، راست، وcargo"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"eeb6c7950d24461d1be3ab5416c9114468568256ae5349d1afb3f61aa51b3408","qualityScore":45}');
