ار الوحدوي مع mocks","اختبار النهاية إلى النهاية مع WebDriver","التكامل مع CI","دعم Tauri v2","استخدام وحدة @tauri-apps/api/mocks"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to test Tauri apps","testing-tauri-apps setup guide","Tauri v2 testing strategies","WebDriver protocol for Tauri","CI integration for Tauri testing","testing-tauri-apps vs Jest","install testing-tauri-apps","what is testing-tauri-apps","testing-tauri-apps alternative","Tauri app testing best practices"],"zh":["Tauri 应用程序测试","Tauri v2 测试","单元测试","端到端测试","CI 集成","WebDriver","Tauri API 模拟"],"ja":["Tauri アプリケーションのテスト","Tauri v2 テスト","ユニットテスト","エンドツーエンドテスト","CI 統合","WebDriver","Tauri API モック"],"ko":["Tauri 애플리케이션 테스트","Tauri v2 테스트","유닛 테스트","엔드 투 엔드 테스트","CI 통합","WebDriver","Tauri API 모의"],"es":["testing tauri","testing de unidad","testing de extremo a extremo","webdriver","ci","tauri v2","herramientas de testing","estrategias de testing","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["testing tauri","tests unitaires","tests de bout en bout","webdriver","ci","tauri v2","outils de testing","stratégies de testing","développement d''applications"],"de":["tauri testing","einheitstests","end-to-end-tests","webdriver","ci","tauri v2","testtools","teststrategien","anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["testes de aplicativos Tauri","teste unitário Tauri","teste de ponta a ponta Tauri","integração com CI Tauri","Tauri v2","mocks Tauri","WebDriver Tauri"],"ru":["тестирование приложений Tauri","юнит-тестирование Tauri","тестирование от начала до конца Tauri","интеграция с CI Tauri","Tauri v2","mocks Tauri","WebDriver Tauri"],"ar":["اختبار تطبيقات Tauri","اختبار الوحدوي Tauri","اختبار النهاية إلى النهاية Tauri","التكامل مع CI Tauri","Tauri v2","mocks Tauri","WebDriver Tauri"]}},"owner":"rdjakovic","repo":"todo2","repoPath":"rdjakovic/todo2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T17:21:59Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"testing-tauri-apps","description":"Guides developers through testing Tauri applications including unit testing with mock runtime, mocking Tauri APIs, WebDriver end-to-end testing with Selenium and WebdriverIO, and CI integration with GitHub Actions.","bodyPreview":"# Testing Tauri Applications\n\nThis skill covers testing strategies for Tauri v2 applications: unit testing with mocks, end-to-end testing with WebDriver, and CI integration.\n\n## Testing Approaches Overview\n\nTauri supports two primary testing methodologies:\n\n1. **Unit/Integration Testing** - Uses a mock runtime without executing native webview libraries\n2. **End-to-End Testing** - Uses WebDriver protocol for browser automation\n\n## Mocking Tauri APIs\n\nThe `@tauri-apps/api/mocks` module simulates a","body":"# Testing Tauri Applications\n\nThis skill covers testing strategies for Tauri v2 applications: unit testing with mocks, end-to-end testing with WebDriver, and CI integration.\n\n## Testing Approaches Overview\n\nTauri supports two primary testing methodologies:\n\n1. **Unit/Integration Testing** - Uses a mock runtime without executing native webview libraries\n2. **End-to-End Testing** - Uses WebDriver protocol for browser automation\n\n## Mocking Tauri APIs\n\nThe `@tauri-apps/api/mocks` module simulates a Tauri environment during frontend testing.\n\n### Install Mock Dependencies\n\n```bash\nnpm install -D vitest @tauri-apps/api\n```\n\n### Mock IPC Commands\n\n```javascript\nimport { mockIPC, clearMocks } from ''@tauri-apps/api/mocks'';\nimport { invoke } from ''@tauri-apps/api/core'';\nimport { vi, describe, it, expect, afterEach } from ''vitest'';\n\nafterEach(() => {\n  clearMocks();\n});\n\ndescribe(''Tauri Commands'', () => {\n  it(''should mock the add command'', async () => {\n    mockIPC((cmd, args) => {\n      if (cmd === ''add'') {\n        return (args.a as number) + (args.b as number);\n      }\n    });\n\n    const result = await invoke(''add'', { a: 12, b: 15 });\n    expect(result).toBe(27);\n  });\n\n  it(''should verify invoke was called'', async () => {\n    mockIPC((cmd) => {\n      if (cmd === ''greet'') return ''Hello!'';\n    });\n\n    const spy = vi.spyOn(window.__TAURI_INTERNALS__, ''invoke'');\n    await invoke(''greet'', { name: ''World'' });\n    expect(spy).toHaveBeenCalled();\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Mock Sidecar and Shell Commands\n\n```javascript\nimport { mockIPC } from ''@tauri-apps/api/mocks'';\n\nmockIPC(async (cmd, args) => {\n  if (args.message.cmd === ''execute'') {\n    const eventCallbackId = `_${args.message.onEventFn}`;\n    const eventEmitter = window[eventCallbackId];\n    eventEmitter({ event: ''Stdout'', payload: ''process output data'' });\n    eventEmitter({ event: ''Terminated'', payload: { code: 0 } });\n  }\n});\n```\n\n### Mock Events (v2.7.0+)\n\n```javascript\nimport { mockIPC } from ''@tauri-apps/api/mocks'';\nimport { emit, listen } from ''@tauri-apps/api/event'';\n\nmockIPC(() => {}, { shouldMockEvents: true });\n\nconst eventHandler = vi.fn();\nawait listen(''test-event'', eventHandler);\nawait emit(''test-event'', { foo: ''bar'' });\nexpect(eventHandler).toHaveBeenCalled();\n```\n\n### Mock Windows\n\n```javascript\nimport { mockWindows } from ''@tauri-apps/api/mocks'';\nimport { getCurrent, getAll } from ''@tauri-apps/api/webviewWindow'';\n\nmockWindows(''main'', ''second'', ''third'');\n\n// First parameter is the \"current\" window\nexpect(getCurrent()).toHaveProperty(''label'', ''main'');\nexpect(getAll().map((w) => w.label)).toEqual([''main'', ''second'', ''third'']);\n```\n\n### Vitest Configuration\n\n```javascript\n// vitest.config.js\nimport { defineConfig } from ''vitest/config'';\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  test: {\n    environment: ''jsdom'',\n    setupFiles: [''./test/setup.js''],\n  },\n});\n\n// test/setup.js\nwindow.__TAURI_INTERNALS__ = {\n  invoke: vi.fn(),\n  transformCallback: vi.fn(),\n};\n```\n\n## WebDriver End-to-End Testing\n\nWebDriver testing uses `tauri-driver` to automate Tauri applications.\n\n### Platform Support\n\n| Platform | Support | Notes |\n|----------|---------|-------|\n| Windows | Full | Requires Microsoft Edge Driver |\n| Linux | Full | Requires WebKitWebDriver |\n| macOS | None | WKWebView lacks WebDriver tooling |\n\n### Install tauri-driver\n\n```bash\ncargo install tauri-driver --locked\n```\n\n### Platform Dependencies\n\n```bash\n# Linux (Debian/Ubuntu)\nsudo apt install webkit2gtk-driver xvfb\nwhich WebKitWebDriver  # Verify installation\n\n# Windows (PowerShell)\ncargo install --git https://github.com/chippers/msedgedriver-tool\n& \"$HOME/.cargo/bin/msedgedriver-tool.exe\"\n```\n\n## WebdriverIO Setup\n\n### Project Structure\n\n```\nmy-tauri-app/\n├── src-tauri/\n├── src/\n└── e2e-tests/\n    ├── package.json\n    ├── wdio.conf.js\n    └── specs/\n        └── app.spec.js\n```\n\n### Package Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"tauri-e2e-tests\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"scripts\": { \"test\": \"wdio run wdio.conf.js\" },\n  \"dependencies\": { \"@wdio/cli\": \"^9.19.0\" },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@wdio/local-runner\": \"^9.19.0\",\n    \"@wdio/mocha-framework\": \"^9.19.0\",\n    \"@wdio/spec-reporter\": \"^9.19.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### WebdriverIO Configuration\n\n```javascript\n// e2e-tests/wdio.conf.js\nimport { spawn, spawnSync } from ''child_process'';\n\nlet tauriDriver;\n\nexport const config = {\n  hostname: ''127.0.0.1'',\n  port: 4444,\n  specs: [''./specs/**/*.js''],\n  maxInstances: 1,\n  capabilities: [{\n    browserName: ''wry'',\n    ''tauri:options'': {\n      application: ''../src-tauri/target/debug/my-tauri-app'',\n    },\n  }],\n  framework: ''mocha'',\n  reporters: [''spec''],\n  mochaOpts: { ui: ''bdd'', timeout: 60000 },\n\n  onPrepare: () => {\n    const result = spawnSync(''cargo'', [''build'', ''--manifest-path'', ''../src-tauri/Cargo.toml''], {\n      stdio: ''inherit'',\n    });\n    if (result.status !== 0) throw new Error(''Failed to build Tauri app'');\n  },\n\n  beforeSession: () => {\n    tauriDriver = spawn(''tauri-driver'', [], { stdio: [''ignore'', ''pipe'', ''pipe''] });\n    return new Promise((resolve) => {\n      tauriDriver.stdout.on(''data'', (data) => {\n        if (data.toString().includes(''listening'')) resolve();\n      });\n    });\n  },\n\n  afterSession: () => tauriDriver?.kill(),\n};\n```\n\n### WebdriverIO Test Example\n\n```javascript\n// e2e-tests/specs/app.spec.js\ndescribe(''My Tauri App'', () => {\n  it(''should display the header'', async () => {\n    const header = await $(''body > h1'');\n    expect(await header.getText()).toMatch(/^[hH]ello/);\n  });\n\n  it(''should interact with a button'', async () => {\n    const button = await $(''#greet-button'');\n    await button.click();\n    const output = await $(''#greet-output'');\n    await output.waitForExist({ timeout: 5000 });\n    expect(await output.getText()).toContain(''Hello'');\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## Selenium Setup\n\n### Package Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"tauri-selenium-tests\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"scripts\": { \"test\": \"mocha\" },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"chai\": \"^5.2.1\",\n    \"mocha\": \"^11.7.1\",\n    \"selenium-webdriver\": \"^4.34.0\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Selenium Test Example\n\n```javascript\n// e2e-tests/test/test.js\nimport { spawn, spawnSync } from ''child_process'';\nimport path from ''path'';\nimport { fileURLToPath } from ''url'';\nimport { Builder, By } from ''selenium-webdriver'';\nimport { expect } from ''chai'';\n\nconst __dirname = path.dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url));\nlet driver, tauriDriver;\nconst application = path.resolve(__dirname, ''../../src-tauri/target/debug/my-tauri-app'');\n\ndescribe(''Tauri App Tests'', function () {\n  this.timeout(60000);\n\n  before(async function () {\n    spawnSync(''cargo'', [''build'', ''--manifest-path'', ''../../src-tauri/Cargo.toml''], {\n      cwd: __dirname, stdio: ''inherit'',\n    });\n\n    tauriDriver = spawn(''tauri-driver'', [], { stdio: [''ignore'', ''pipe'', ''pipe''] });\n    await new Promise((resolve) => {\n      tauriDriver.stdout.on(''data'', (data) => {\n        if (data.toString().includes(''listening'')) resolve();\n      });\n    });\n\n    driver = await new Builder()\n      .usingServer(''http://127.0.0.1:4444/'')\n      .withCapabilities({ browserName: ''wry'', ''tauri:options'': { application } })\n      .build();\n  });\n\n  after(async function () {\n    await driver?.quit();\n    tauriDriver?.kill();\n  });\n\n  it(''should display greeting'', async function () {\n    const header = await driver.findElement(By.css(''body > h1''));\n    expect(await header.getText()).to.match(/^[hH]ello/);\n  });\n\n  it(''should click button and show output'', async function () {\n    const button = await driver.findElement(By.id(''greet-button''));\n    await button.click();\n    const output = await driver.findElement(By.id(''greet-output''));\n    expect(await output.getText()).to.include(''Hello'');\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## CI Integration with GitHub Actions\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/e2e-tests.yml\nname: E2E Tests\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n  pull_request:\n    branches: [main]\n\njobs:\n  test:\n    strategy:\n      fail-fast: false\n      matrix:\n        os: [ubuntu-latest, windows-latest]\n    runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Install Linux dependencies\n        if: matrix.os == ''ubuntu-latest''\n        run: |\n          sudo apt-get update\n          sudo apt-get install -y libwebkit2gtk-4.1-dev build-essential \\\n            curl wget file libxdo-dev libssl-dev \\\n            libayatana-appindicator3-dev librsvg2-dev \\\n            webkit2gtk-driver xvfb\n\n      - uses: dtolnay/rust-action@stable\n      - run: cargo install tauri-driver --locked\n\n      - name: Setup Windows WebDriver\n        if: matrix.os == ''windows-latest''\n        shell: pwsh\n        run: |\n          cargo install --git https://github.com/chippers/msedgedriver-tool\n          & \"$HOME/.cargo/bin/msedgedriver-tool.exe\"\n\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: ''20''\n\n      - run: npm install\n      - run: npm run build\n      - run: cargo build --manifest-path src-tauri/Cargo.toml\n\n      - name: Run E2E tests (Linux)\n        if: matrix.os == ''ubuntu-latest''\n        working-directory: e2e-tests\n        run: npm install && xvfb-run npm test\n\n      - name: Run E2E tests (Windows)\n        if: matrix.os == ''windows-latest''\n        working-directory: e2e-tests\n        run: npm install && npm test\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Mock Testing\n- Always call `clearMocks()` in `afterEach` to prevent state leakage\n- Use spies to verify IPC calls were made correctly\n- Mock at the right level: IPC for commands, windows for multi-window logic\n\n### WebDriver Testing\n- Use debug builds for faster iteration during development\n- Set appropriate timeouts as Tauri apps may need time to initialize\n- Wait for elements explicitly rather than using implicit waits\n- Keep tests independent so each test works in isolation\n\n### CI Integration\n- Use `xvfb-run` on Linux for headless WebDriver testing\n- Match Edge Driver version on Windows to avoid connection issues\n- Build the app before running WebDriver tests\n- Run unit tests before e2e tests to catch issues early\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### WebDriver Connection Timeout\n- Windows: Verify Edge Driver version matches installed Edge\n- Linux: Ensure `webkit2gtk-driver` is installed\n- Check `tauri-driver` is running and listening on port 4444\n\n### Mock Not Working\n- Import `@tauri-apps/api/mocks` before the code under test\n- Call `clearMocks()` in `afterEach` to reset state\n- Ensure `window.__TAURI_INTERNALS__` is properly mocked in setup\n\n### CI Failures\n- Linux: Add `xvfb-run` prefix to test commands\n- Windows: Install Edge Driver via `msedgedriver-tool`\n- Increase timeout for slower CI runners\n\n## References\n\n- [Tauri Testing Documentation](https://v2.tauri.app/develop/tests/)\n- [tauri-driver on crates.io](https://crates.io/crates/tauri-driver)\n- [WebDriver Example Repository](https://github.com/tauri-apps/webdriver-example)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:14:09.443Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents specializing in frontend development, such as Cursor or AutoGPT, needing to test Tauri applications with unit testing and end-to-end testing capabilities.","zh":"适用于专注于前端开发的AI代理，例如Cursor或AutoGPT，需要使用单元测试和端到端测试功能来测试Tauri应用程序。","ja":"フロントエンド開発を専門とするAIエージェント（例：CursorまたはAutoGPT）に適しています。これらのエージェントは、単体テストとエンドツーエンドテストの機能を使用してTauriアプリケーションをテストする必要があります。","ko":"프론트엔드 개발을 전문으로 하는 AI 에이전트(Cursor 또는 AutoGPT와 같은)에 적합합니다. 이러한 에이전트는 단위 테스트 및 종단 간 테스트 기능을 사용하여 Tauri 애플리케이션을 테스트해야 합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA especializados en desarrollo frontend, como Cursor o AutoGPT, que necesitan probar aplicaciones de Tauri con capacidades de prueba unitaria y de extremo a extremo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA spécialisés dans le développement frontend, tels que Cursor ou AutoGPT, ayant besoin de tester des applications Tauri avec des capacités de test unitaire et de bout en bout.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die auf Frontend-Entwicklung spezialisiert sind, wie z.B. Cursor oder AutoGPT, und die Tauri-Anwendungen mit Einheitstests und End-to-End-Tests testen möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA especializados em desenvolvimento frontend, como Cursor ou AutoGPT, que precisam testar aplicações Tauri com capacidades de teste unitário e teste de ponta a ponta.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, специализирующихся на разработке frontend, таких как Cursor или AutoGPT, которым необходимо тестировать приложения Tauri с возможностями модульного тестирования и тестирования от начала до конца.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتخصصين في تطوير واجهة المستخدم، مثل Cursor أو AutoGPT، الذين يحتاجون إلى اختبار تطبيقات Tauri مع قدرات الاختبار الوحداتي واختبار نهاية إلى نهاية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to test Tauri v2 applications using unit testing with mocks from the @tauri-apps/api/mocks module and end-to-end testing with WebDriver, supporting seamless CI integration for robust application validation.","zh":"赋予代理使用单元测试和WebDriver的端到端测试功能来测试Tauri v2应用程序，支持从@tauri-apps/api/mocks模块获取mock，并实现CI集成以进行强大的应用程序验证。","ja":"エージェントにTauri v2アプリケーションをテストするための単体テストとWebDriverを使用したエンドツーエンドテスト機能を提供し、@tauri-apps/api/mocksモジュールからのモックを使用してCIの統合をサポートし、堅牢なアプリケーションの検証を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Tauri v2 애플리케이션을 테스트하는 단위 테스트 및 WebDriver를 사용한 종단 간 테스트 기능을 제공하고, @tauri-apps/api/mocks 모듈에서 모ック를 가져와 CI 통합을 지원하여 강력한 애플리케이션 검증을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a probar aplicaciones de Tauri v2 utilizando pruebas unitarias con mocks del módulo @tauri-apps/api/mocks y pruebas de extremo a extremo con WebDriver, lo que admite una integración de CI fluida para una validación de aplicaciones robusta.","fr":"Permet aux agents de tester des applications Tauri v2 en utilisant des tests unitaires avec des mocks du module @tauri-apps/api/mocks et des tests de bout en bout avec WebDriver, ce qui prend en charge une intégration CI transparente pour une validation d''applications robuste.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Tauri v2-Anwendungen mit Einheitstests unter Verwendung von Mocks aus dem @tauri-apps/api/mocks-Modul und End-to-End-Tests mit WebDriver zu testen, was eine nahtlose CI-Integration für eine robuste Anwendungsvalidierung ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a testar aplicações Tauri v2 usando testes unitários com mocks do módulo @tauri-apps/api/mocks e testes de ponta a ponta com WebDriver, suportando integração CI sem interrupção para validação de aplicativos robusta.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью тестировать приложения Tauri v2 с помощью модульных тестов с mocks из модуля @tauri-apps/api/mocks и тестирования от начала до конца с помощью WebDriver, поддерживая бесшовную интеграцию CI для надёжной проверки приложений.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على اختبار تطبيقات Tauri v2 باستخدام الاختبارات الوحداتية مع mocks من وحدة @tauri-apps/api/mocks واختبار نهاية إلى نهاية مع WebDriver، يدعم التكامل السلس ل CI لتحقق التطبيق القوي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating unit tests for Tauri applications with mock runtime","Performing end-to-end testing using WebDriver protocol for browser automation","Integrating testing workflows with CI pipelines for continuous validation"],"zh":["使用模拟运行时为Tauri应用程序自动化单元测试","使用WebDriver协议进行浏览器自动化的端到端测试","将测试工作流与CI管道集成以进行持续验证"],"ja":["モックランタイムを使用してTauriアプリケーションの単体テストを自動化する","WebDriverプロトコルを使用したブラウザ自動化のエンドツーエンドテストの実行","テストワークフローをCIパイプラインに統合して継続的な検証を実現する"],"ko":["모의 런타임을 사용하여 Tauri 애플리케이션의 단위 테스트를 자동화하는 것","WebDriver 프로토콜을 사용한 브라우저 자동화의 종단 간 테스트를 수행하는 것","테스트 워크플ロー를 CI 파이프라인에 통합하여 지속적인 검증을 구현하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas unitarias para aplicaciones de Tauri con tiempo de ejecución mock","Realizar pruebas de extremo a extremo utilizando el protocolo WebDriver para la automatización del navegador","Integrar flujos de trabajo de prueba con tuberías de CI para una validación continua"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests unitaires pour les applications Tauri avec un mock runtime","Effectuer des tests de bout en bout en utilisant le protocole WebDriver pour l''automatisation du navigateur","Intégrer les flux de travail de test avec les pipelines de CI pour une validation continue"],"de":["Automatisieren von Einheitstests für Tauri-Anwendungen mit Mock-Laufzeit","Durchführen von End-to-End-Tests unter Verwendung des WebDriver-Protokolls für die Browserautomatisierung","Integrieren von Testworkflows mit CI-Pipelines für eine kontinuierliche Validierung"],"pt":["Automatizar testes unitários para aplicações Tauri com tempo de execução mock","Realizar testes de ponta a ponta usando protocolo WebDriver para automação do navegador","Integrar fluxos de trabalho de teste com pipelines CI para validação contínua"],"ru":["Автоматизировать модульные тесты для приложений Tauri с mock-окружением","Выполнять тестирование от начала до конца с помощью протокола WebDriver для автоматизации браузера","Интегрировать рабочие процессы тестирования с конвейерами CI для непрерывной проверки"],"ar":["أتمتة الاختبارات الوحداتية لتطبيقات Tauri مع وقت تشغيل mock","إجراء اختبارات نهاية إلى نهاية باستخدام بروتوكول WebDriver لآلية متصفح","دمج سير عمل الاختبار مع أنابيب CI للتحقق المستمر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Tauri v2 application setup","Limited to unit testing and end-to-end testing methodologies"],"zh":["需要Tauri v2应用程序设置","仅限于单元测试和端到端测试方法论"],"ja":["Tauri v2アプリケーションの設定が必要","単体テストとエンドツーエンドテストの方法論のみに限定される"],"ko":["Tauri v2 애플리케이션 설정이 필요합니다.","단위 테스트 및 종단 간 테스트 방법론으로만 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere configuración de la aplicación Tauri v2","Limitado a metodologías de prueba unitaria y de extremo a extremo"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''application Tauri v2","Limité aux méthodologies de test unitaire et de bout en bout"],"de":["Erfordert Tauri v2-Anwendungskonfiguration","Begrenzt auf Einheitstest- und End-to-End-Testmethoden"],"pt":["Exige configuração de aplicação Tauri v2","Limitado a metodologias de teste unitário e teste de ponta a ponta"],"ru":["Требует настройки приложения Tauri v2","Ограничен методологиями модульного тестирования и тестирования от начала до конца"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تطبيق Tauri v2","محدود بأساليب اختبار الوحدات واختبار نهاية إلى نهاية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"aa6d1c0df7fb185ffbf3be2af6b458296dc4d6a633455ea29c55ca30a553fcd3","qualityScore":45}');
