INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('charl-kruger/charl/wrangler', 'wrangler', 'charl-kruger', 'charl', 'community', 'wrangler charl-kruger charl community The Wrangler skill enables developers to deploy, develop, and manage Cloudflare Workers and associated resources. It provides a command-line interface for efficient workflow management. Wrangler 是一种命令行工具，用于部署、开发和管理 Cloudflare Workers。它支持 JSON 配置和兼容性日期设置 Wrangler は、Cloudflare Workers を開発および管理するための CLI ツールです。JSON 構成と互換性日設定をサポートしています Wrangler는 클라우드플레어 워커를 배포, 개발 및 관리하는 명령줄 도구입니다. JSON 구성 및 호환성 날짜 설정을 지원합니다 Wrangler es una herramienta de línea de comandos para deployar y gestionar Workers de Cloudflare Wrangler est un outil en ligne de commande pour déployer et gérer les Workers Cloudflare Wrangler ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool zum Bereitstellen und Verwalten von Cloudflare-Workern O Wrangler é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para desenvolver e gerenciar Cloudflare Workers. Veja como configurá-lo e usá-lo. Wrangler - это инструмент командной строки для разработки и управления Cloudflare Workers. Узнайте, как настроить и использовать его с помощью ИИ Агентов. Wrangler هو أداة سطر أوامر لتطوير و إدارة Cloudflare Workers. تعلم كيفية إعدادها و استخدامها مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي how to use wrangler wrangler setup guide cloudflare workers tutorial wrangler vs serverless wrangler install wrangler json config what is wrangler wrangler compatibility dates wrangler alternative Wrangler Cloudflare Workers JSON 配置 兼容性日期设置 命令行工具 AIエージェント 云计算 Verifies Wrangler installation using the `wrangler --version` command Installs Wrangler using `npm install -D wrangler@latest` Supports JSON config via `wrangler.jsonc` files Requires setting a recent `compatibility_date` for optimal performance Enables management of Cloudflare Workers and associated resources Wrangler is a CLI tool for deploying, developing, and managing Cloudflare Workers and related resources, utilizing JSON config and compatibility dates.');
