INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('stephenhuo-code/sunnyagent/skill-creator', 'skill-creator', 'stephenhuo-code', 'sunnyagent', 'community', 'skill-creator stephenhuo-code sunnyagent community The skill-creator is a specialized AI agent skill that provides developers with guidance for creating modular, self-contained packages. It helps build skills that transform Claude from a general-purpose agent into a specialized one equipped with domain-specific workflows and procedural knowledge. Skill Creator 是一个提供创建有效技能的指导的技能，帮助开发者扩展 AI 工具的能力 スキルクリエーターは、AI エージェントの能力を拡張するための専門知識とワークフローを提供する技能です 스킬 크리에이터는 개발자가 전문 지식과 워크플로우를 제공하는技能을 생성할 수 있도록 도와주는 기술입니다 Skill Creator es una herramienta que proporciona orientación para crear habilidades efectivas que amplían las capacidades de los Agentes de IA Skill Creator est un outil qui fournit des conseils pour créer des compétences efficaces qui étendent les capacités des Outils d''IA Skill Creator ist ein Tool, das Anleitungen zur Erstellung effektiver Fähigkeiten bietet, um die Fähigkeiten von KI-Agenten zu erweitern O Skill Creator é uma habilidade que fornece orientação para a criação de habilidades eficazes, permitindo que os agentes de IA se tornem especializados em domínios ou tarefas específicas. Skill Creator — это навык, который предоставляет руководство по созданию эффективных навыков, позволяя ИИ Агентам стать специалистами в конкретных областях или задачах. Skill Creator هو مهارة يوفر إرشادات لإنشاء مهارات فعالة، مما يسمح لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي بأن تصبح مخصصة في مجالات أو مهام معينة. how to use skill-creator what is skill-creator AI agent skill-creator vs other AI tools skill-creator installation guide skill-creator setup tutorial creating modular AI skills Claude skill development AI agent workflow creation skill-creator best practices Skill Creator AI 工具 创建技能 扩展能力 专门工作流程 开发者指南 AI 技术 技能开发 Provides guidance for creating modular, self-contained skill packages Extends Claude''s capabilities with specialized domain knowledge Enables development of specialized workflows for AI agents Transforms general-purpose agents into domain-specific experts Delivers procedural knowledge that base models cannot possess skill-creator is an AI agent skill that provides structured guidance for creating modular skill packages. These packages extend Claude''s capabilities by providing specialized domain knowledge, multi-step workflows, and procedural expertise that the base model cannot possess on its own.');
